<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">

        <p><strong>Rehearsal Mode</strong> is a no-pressure way to get familiar with live selling on Lively.</p>
        <p>It lets you run a simulated show with practice bids and no real audience, so you can build confidence before going live.</p>

        <h2>How Rehearsal Mode works</h2>

        <p>In Rehearsal Mode, you can:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Follow a guided tour</li>
            <li>Practice live selling with preloaded demo products</li>
            <li>Try features like pinning items and running auctions with test buyers (not real accounts)</li>
            <li>Build confidence before your live shows</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="article-info-box">
            <strong>Tip:</strong> Want to test with friends or team members? <a href="#">Schedule a private show instead.</a>
        </div>

        <h2>Access Rehearsal Mode</h2>

        <p>Most sellers can access Rehearsal Mode from Seller Hub in the Lively mobile app.</p>

        <div class="article-note-box">
            <strong>Note:</strong> New sellers may not see Seller Hub or Rehearsal Mode until after their first live show. Complete your first show to unlock full access to these tools.
        </div>

        <p><strong>To open Rehearsal Mode:</strong></p>
        <ol>
            <li>Open the Lively app.</li>
            <li>Tap Seller Hub.</li>
            <li>Open the menu in the top right.</li>
            <li>Scroll down to Settings.</li>
            <li>Tap Rehearsal Mode.</li>
        </ol>

        <p>Return to Rehearsal Mode anytime to practice as often as you need.</p>

